  NoteName: Anonymous
  NoteText: "If anyone hears this... Don't stay still. What came out of the ice is
    not from this earth. I \r\ncan no longer distinguish the ground from them, the
    light reveals them. The tower is not \r\nsafe. \r\n\r\nI'm turning off the radio.
    Sullivan"
